      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#9A9D62] mb-4">Serving Dover and nearby towns</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22]">Service Areas We Cover in Delaware</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          1st Capital Locksmith brings fast, mobile locksmith service directly to your neighborhood. We are proud to support homes, vehicles, and businesses across Dover, Kent, and Southern Delaware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
