          <p class="text-gray-600">Reliable residential and commercial locksmith support throughout the Milford area.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/service-areas/smyrna-de/" class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 text-center hover:border-[#A61E22] hover:shadow-md transition block">
