      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Fast Mobile Response</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Our locksmith van comes to your location quickly in Dover and nearby Delaware towns for lockouts, lost keys, and urgent security issues.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Transparent Pricing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Clear locksmith pricing with no surprise charges, so you know the cost before we begin automotive, residential, or commercial work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Experienced Locksmiths</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          Skilled technicians handle car key replacement, ignition repair, lock rekeying, panic bar installation, and more.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">On-Site Service</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
          We bring the tools and expertise to your home, business, or vehicle so your locksmith issue is solved immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Residential & Commercial Locks</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">
